'''Magus Destruct''' is an [[Arcane Enhancement]] for the [[Operator]]. Whenever the Operator performs a [[Void Sling]] on an enemy, they will become more vulnerable to {{D|Puncture}} damage.

==Effect==
{| class="emodtable"
|-
! Rank
! % Reduced resistance
|-
| 0 || 12%
|-
