|-
| 4 || 60%
|-
| 5 || 65%
|}

==Acquisition==
Can be bought from [[Vox Solaris (Syndicate)|Vox Solaris]] for {{sc|10,000}} upon reaching the rank of '''Instrument'''.

==Notes==
*The effect will apply a permanent stacking [[Damage Vulnerability]] debuff for all {{D|Puncture}} damage done to an enemy.
**Can be applied multiple times with no limit, with each application stacking additively with each other.
**For example, using an {{Weapon|AX-52}} modded with {{M|Serration}} and {{M|Piercing Caliber}} against an enemy affected with '''3''' stacks of a max rank Magus Destruct will deal:
:::{{Math|40 * (1 + {{M|Serration|165%}}) * (1 + {{M|Piercing Caliber|120%}}) * (1 + 3 * {{Arcane|Magus Destruct|65%}})|t=y|bf-a=y}} damage before any damage reduction or resistances.
*Has no effect on [[Eidolon]]s.

==Tips==
*Synergizes with {{Arcane|Virtuos Spike}}.

